# Line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks these out with CRLF, which makes every
# formatter that reads the working tree report a violation on every file. Measured
# 2026-08-07: `gofmt -l` over the tracked Go files reported 678 of 925; against the
# LF content in the index the real number was 26. A gate the operator cannot
# reproduce on their own machine is its own defect class, so the tools that CI runs
# must see the same bytes locally.
#
# Anything a formatter, linter or diff-based gate reads is pinned to LF here.

*.go   text eol=lf
*.mod  text eol=lf
*.sum  text eol=lf

*.ts   text eol=lf
*.tsx  text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.jsx   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf

*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
